Credits and third-party material
--------------------------------
Joystick Diagrams
  github.com/Rexeh/joystick-diagrams (GPL-2.0). The VKB Gladiator NXT template slot positions in
  site/js/slotmap.js come from its templates. The oracle tests also use data from its Star Citizen
  plugin (github.com/Rexeh/joystick-diagrams-star-citizen-plugin, GPL-2.0); those tests are not part
  of the published site.

VKB Gladiator fillable templates
  VKB Gladiator fillable templates by VKB (vkbgaming.com), template design by UntoldForce (v1.0).
  Free to use per VKB (confirmed 2026-11-11). The template pages in site/art/vkb/ are used
  unmodified apart from the bind text this tool writes over them; the VKB Discord link and the
  design credit printed on the templates are part of the art and stay on every card.

Star Citizen
